      "name": "Stomp",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The war aurochs strikes the ground with its hooves, causing tremors in a 30ft Type:emanation. Creatures in the area must attempt a DC 25 Reflex Saving Throw save or be knocked Prone.</p>",
